{"{n} colors":"{n} 種顏色","Fill every color quota to win. Some stages limit your moves or time — unused moves and fast finishes earn bonus points.":"填晒每個顏色配額贏。有啲階段會限制你嘅動作或者時間 — 未用過嘅動作同埋快速完成會獲得額外積分。","Tap a group of two or more touching cubes of the same color to pop it. Bigger groups score more.":"撳一組兩個或以上同一顏色嘅觸摸立方體就可以彈出佢。大啲嘅組別得分會高啲。","This group fills a goal color.":"呢個群組填充一個目標顏色。","A new color joins the wall: grape.":"一種新顏色加入牆：葡萄紫。","Rockets are the fastest way to fill two colors at once.":"火箭係一次過填兩種顏色嘅最快方法。","The sixth color: tangerine. The wall gets busier.":"第六種顏色：橘。牆越嚟越忙。","MASTERY: six colors, tight budget.":"掌握：六色，預算緊張。","Six-Color Squeeze":"六色擠壓","Only three colors — giant groups and bombs everywhere. 14 moves, no undo.":"只有三種顏色 — 巨型群體同炸彈到處都係。 14個動作，冇復原。","Four colors in 90 seconds. No undo.":"90 秒內四種顏色。冇復原。","Cubes of the same color stick together. Tap any group of 2 or more matching cubes to pop them. Try it now — any group works.":"同色方塊會黐埋一齊。撳任何 2 個或以上相同顏色方塊嘅組合嚟爆佢哋。而家試下 — 任何組合都得。","That move is not allowed.":"該步唔允許。","Popped {n} cubes.":"彈出 {n} 立方體。","Rocket forged.":"火箭鍛造。","Rocket fired.":"火箭發射。","Bomb forged.":"炸彈鑄成。","Bomb exploded.":"炸彈爆炸。","Chain of {n} specials.":"由 {n} 個特殊組成嘅連鎖。","Board reshuffled.":"棋盤已重洗。","Move undone.":"已復原上一步。","Hint shown.":"提示顯示。","Stage complete.":"階段完成。","Round over.":"回合結束。","Wave {n} complete.":"波 {n} 完成。","Achievement unlocked.":"成就已解鎖。","Goal filled.":"目標完成。","15 seconds left.":"仲有 15 秒。","{keys} (reset)":"{keys} （重置）","(unlock at {n}★)":"（喺 {n}★ 解鎖）","Tutorial reset. Lesson 1 is ready.":"教學重設。第一課準備好喇。","Reset journey stars, achievements, and saved rounds?":"重設旅程星星、成就同埋儲存咗嘅回合？","Progress reset.":"進度已重設。","{n} moves":"{n} 步","endless":"無盡","Finish the previous stage to unlock.":"完成上一個階段就可以解鎖。","done":"完成","Seed {seed}":"種子 {seed}","no move limit":"冇動作限制","Your best today: {n} points":"你今日最好嘅： {n} 分","New challenge in {h}h {m}m (server-synced).":"{h}h {m}m （伺服器同步）嘅新挑戰。","offline-capable":"離線功能","Playing as {name}":"以 {name} 身份遊玩","progress synced":"進度已同步","saving…":"儲存中…","cloud sync unavailable":"雲端同步不可用","No scores on this device yet today.":"今日呢部裝置仲未有任何分數。","{score} pts · wave {wave}":"{score} 分 · 波 {wave}","No runs yet.":"仲未有跑步。","Pop groups":"流行組合","Tap a connected group of 2 or more matching cubes to pop them. Popped cubes count toward the goals on the left.":"㩒一下一個由2個或以上匹配嘅立方體組成嘅連接咗嘅群組嚟彈出佢哋。彈出嘅立方體計入咗邊嘅目標。","Rockets":"火箭","A group of 5+ leaves a rocket on the tapped cube. Tap the rocket to clear its whole row or column. Taller groups make column rockets; wider groups make row rockets.":"一組5個或以上會喺撳過嘅立方體留低火箭。撳火箭嚟清除成行或者成列。越高嘅組合產生列火箭；越闊嘅組合產生行火箭。","Bombs":"炸彈","A group of 8+ leaves a bomb. Tap it to clear a 3×3 area around it.":"一組8個或以上會留低炸彈。撳佢嚟清除周圍3×3區域。","Chains":"連鎖","Blasts that touch other specials set them off too. Each extra special in one move earns a chain bonus.":"碰到其他特殊方塊嘅爆炸會連帶引爆。一步入面每個額外特殊方塊有連鎖獎勵。","Goals and limits":"目標同限制","No dead ends":"冇死路一條","If no legal move remains, the wall reshuffles itself for free.":"如果冇合法嘅動作，牆就會免費重新洗牌。","Assists":"輔助功能","Where allowed: H shows a hint, U undoes your last pop. Challenges may disable them.":"允許嘅地方： H 顯示提示， U 復原你最後一次彈出。挑戰可能會令佢哋停用。","{color} row rocket":"{color} 排火箭","{color} column rocket":"{color} 柱火箭","{color} bomb":"{color} 炸彈","{color}, group of {n}":"{color}， {n} 群","Row {r} column {c}: {desc}":"{r} 列 {c} ： {desc}","empty":"空白","Daily {date}":"每日 {date}","Fill the goals to win.":"填滿目標去贏。","How to play":"玩法說明","Bigger groups score more.":"越大組得分越多。","Fill every goal to clear the stage.":"填補每一個目標，以通關。","{n} cubes in poppable groups.":"{n} 立方體喺可彈出嘅群組入面。","Fire a special to continue.":"開特別嚟繼續。","Pop!":"啪！","That cube is not in a group of {n} or more.":"嗰個立方體唔係喺一組 {n} 或以上。","That cell is empty.":"該格子是空的。","That cell is outside the wall.":"嗰間牢房喺牆外面。","The round is over.":"回合結束。","Popped {n} {color} cubes. Score {score}.":"彈出 {n} {color} 立方體。分數 {score} 。","No moves left — the wall reshuffled.":"冇咗任何動作 — 牆重新排列。","Wave {n} complete. New goals, +{moves} moves in the bank.":"波 {n} 完成。新目標， + {moves} 喺銀行入面移動。","Achievement: {name}":"成就：{name}","Achievement unlocked: {name}":"解鎖成就：{name}","All goals complete!":"所有目標完成！","Out of moves":"步數用盡","Time is up":"時間到","Round resigned":"本局已放棄","Round over":"回合結束","Lesson complete: {title}":"課程完成：{title}","You win — {reason}":"你贏咗 — {reason}","Cubes cleared ({n})":"已清除方塊（{n}）","Group size bonus":"群組大小獎金","Specials forged ({n})":"特價偽造（ {n} ）","Chain bonus (best ×{n})":"連鎖獎勵（最佳 ×{n}）","Unused moves":"未用過嘅招式","Time under par":"時間低於標準","Wave bonus ({n})":"波浪獎金（ {n} ）","Total":"總計","Round over. {reason} Score {score}.":"圓過嚟。 {reason} 分數 {score} 。","Saved — rank #{rank} on this device ({score} pts).":"儲存咗 — 喺呢部裝置上面排名 # {rank} （ {score} 分）。","Could not save ({error}).":"無法保存（{error}）。","Paused. Round saved locally.":"暫停咗。輪儲存喺本地。","Paused.":"已暫停。","Resumed.":"已繼續。","Journey {done}/{total} · {stars} stars · {ach}/{achTotal} achievements":"旅程 {done}/{total} · {stars} 星星 · {ach}/{achTotal} 成就","Play: {name}":"玩： {name}","Play: Journey":"玩：旅程","Row {r} column {c}, {color} special":"行 {r} 柱 {c} ， {color} 特殊","Row {r} column {c}, {color}, group of {n}":"{r} 列柱 {c} 、 {color} 、 {n} 群","Camera reset.":"鏡頭已重設。","Replay copied.":"重播複製咗。","Select the replay text to copy.":"選擇要複製嘅重播文字。","Hints are disabled in this mode.":"呢個模式停用提示。","This group forges a bomb.":"呢個組織鍛造一個炸彈。","This group forges a rocket.":"呢個組織鍛造一架火箭。","Firing this special starts a chain.":"發射呢個特殊會開始一條鏈。","This is the biggest group.":"呢個係最大嘅群體。","Fire this special.":"炒呢個特別版。","Try here.":"試下呢度。","Hint: row {r} column {c}. {why}":"提示：行 {r} 列 {c} 。 {why}","Hint: {why}":"提示： {why}","Nothing to undo.":"沒有可復原的步驟。","Move undone. Score {score}.":"移動取消。分數 {score} 。","No saved round.":"冇儲存過嘅回合。","Round resumed.":"本局已繼續。","{score} pts ({moves} moves, goals complete)":"{score} 分（ {moves} 走位，目標完成）","{score} pts ({moves} moves)":"{score} 分（ {moves} 移動）","Resume saved round":"繼續已儲存嘅回合","Journey":"旅程","Daily Challenge":"每日挑戰","Practice":"練習","Challenge":"挑戰","Score Chase":"分數追逐","Learn":"學習","Achievements":"成就","Settings":"設定","Help":"幫助","Forty authored stages. Finish a stage to unlock the next; mastery stages test combined mechanics.":"四十個作者階段。完成一個階段就可以解鎖下一個階段；掌握階段測試組合力學。","Back":"返回","Play today's challenge":"玩今日嘅挑戰","Today's board (this device)":"今日嘅板（呢部機）","Unranked. Undo and hints allowed. No effect on ratings.":"未排名。允許復原同提示。對收視率冇影響。","Challenges":"挑戰","Constrained goals: move limits, speed targets, restricted tools.":"限制目標：步數上限、速度目標、限制工具。","Score Chase — Endless Wall":"比分追逐 — 無窮無盡嘅牆","Start run":"開始跑","Your best runs (local)":"你最好跑（本地）","Interactive lessons. Each one asks you to perform the rule yourself.":"互動課。每個都要求你自己執行規則。","Audio":"音效","Show text captions for sounds":"顯示聲音嘅文字字幕","Studio theme":"工作室主題","Accessibility":"無障礙","Left-handed action tray":"左手操作托盤","Progress":"進度","Replay tutorial":"重播教學","Reset all progress":"重設所有進度","Controls":"控制","Action":"操作","Keyboard":"鍵盤","Pointer / touch":"指針/觸摸","Move selection":"移動選擇","Pop / fire":"爆 / 火","Tap a group":"點一下一個群組","Hint":"提示","Hint button":"提示按鈕","Undo":"復原","Undo button":"復原按鈕","Pause":"暫停","Pause button":"暫停按鈕","Orbit camera":"軌道相機","Drag the board":"拖板","Goals":"目標","Score":"分數","Moves":"步數","Time":"時間","Wave":"波浪","Move bank":"搬銀行","Camera":"鏡頭","Paused":"已暫停","Resume":"繼續","Restart round":"重新開始回合","Leave round":"離開回合","Results":"結果","Display name":"顯示名稱","Save to today's board":"儲存到今日嘅板","Retry":"重試","Next":"下一步","Menu":"選單","Copy replay envelope":"複製重播連結","Cherry":"櫻桃","Lemon":"檸檬","Leaf":"葉子","Sky":"天空","Grape":"葡萄","Tangerine":"橘子","Sunny Studio":"陽光工作室","Mint Workshop":"薄荷工作坊","Twilight Loft":"暮光之城","Candy Corner":"糖果角落","Ivory Attic":"象牙閣樓","First Pops":"第一彈","Tap any group of 2+ matching cubes to pop them. Fill the goals on the left.":"撳任何一組2個以上嘅匹配立方體嚟彈出佢哋。填埋咗邊嘅目標。","Bigger is Better":"大就係好","Bigger groups score more. Hunt for the largest cluster.":"越大組得分越多。搵最大嘅一簇。","New: pop 5+ cubes at once to forge a rocket. Tap a rocket to clear its whole line.":"新功能：一次過彈出 5 個以上嘅立方體嚟鍛造火箭。撳火箭就可以清除佢成條線。","Move Budget":"步數預算","New: a move limit. Every tap must count.":"新：一個動作限制。每次撳都要計","Tall Orders":"高大嘅訂單","Bombs Away":"炸彈飛走","New: pop 8+ cubes for a bomb that clears everything around it.":"新功能：彈出 8 個以上嘅立方體，用嚟清除周圍所有嘢嘅炸彈。","Chain Reaction":"連鎖反應","Blasts trigger other specials. Set up chains for huge scores.":"爆炸會觸發其他特殊方塊。砌連鎖攞高分。","Corner Pocket":"角袋","Grape Arrives":"葡萄到喇","Toy Chest":"玩具箱","MASTERY: everything so far, on a bigger wall.":"掌握：到目前為止嘅所有嘢，喺一幅更大嘅牆上。","Wide Wall":"寬牆","Rocket Rally":"火箭集會","Thin Ice":"薄冰","Bomb Squad":"拆彈組","Beat the Clock":"戰勝時鐘","New: a time limit instead of a move limit. Pop briskly.":"新：一個時間限制而唔係一個動作限制。快速彈出嚟。","Tangerine Twist":"橘子扭","Full Spectrum":"全光譜","Pressure Play":"壓力玩法","Double Trouble":"雙重麻煩","Studio Floor":"工作室樓層","Grand Wall":"大城牆","The big wall: eight columns wide.":"大牆：闊八柱。","Sky Harvest":"天空收穫","One huge sky quota, with a leaf side order.":"一個巨大嘅天空配額，有一個葉邊訂單。","Clockwork Pop":"發條爆谷","Rocket Science":"火箭科學","Deep Reserve":"深層儲備","Blast Furnace":"高爐","Narrow Margin":"毫釐之差","Speed Shelf":"速度架","Heavy Mix":"重混音","Grand Parade":"盛大巡遊","MASTERY: the full toy studio at once.":"掌握：一次過玩晒玩具工作室。","Chain Gang":"連鎖幫","Blitz Wall":"閃電牆","Rocket Rain":"火箭雨","Bomb Voyage":"炸彈航程","Tight Squeeze":"窄位","Long Haul":"長途跋涉","Time Crunch":"時間緊迫","Master Budget":"大師預算","Cube Carnival":"方塊嘉年華","MASTERY: the definitive wall. Good luck.":"掌握：絕對嘅牆。祝你好運。","Two-Tone Tangle":"雙音糾纏","Speed Pop":"速度彈出","Frugal Fingers":"慳手指","Nine moves, no assists. Plan every pop.":"九招，冇助攻。計劃每個流行音樂。","Bomb Brigade":"炸彈旅","Bombs come easier (7+). Two big quotas.":"炸彈更容易嚟（7+）。兩個大配額。","Rocket Season":"火箭季．","Rockets come easier (4+), bombs are off the menu.":"火箭嚟得容易啲（4 + ），炸彈係唔喺菜單入面。","Grand Constraint":"大師限制","Move limit, time limit, no assists. The full test.":"步數上限、時間限制、無輔助。完整考驗。","Casual":"悠閒","Apprentice":"學徒","Expert":"專家","Endless Wall":"無盡嘅牆","Goals keep coming in waves. Each wave banked adds moves — play until the bank runs dry.":"目標一直一波波噉嚟。每個波波都會增加招式 — 玩到波波乾晒。","One shared seed for everyone, today only.":"今日限定，所有人共用同一個種子。","Pop a group":"彈出一組","Forge a rocket":"鍛造火箭","Groups of 5 or more leave a rocket behind. Pop the big cherry cluster in the middle — the cube you tap becomes the rocket.":"5 人或以上嘅小組留低一架火箭。彈出中間嘅大櫻桃群 — 你撳嘅立方體就變成火箭。","Fire a rocket":"發射火箭","A rocket sits on the wall. Tap it to clear its whole row or column in one blast.":"一個火箭喺牆上。撳佢嚟一次過清除成行或者成列。","Chain reaction":"連鎖反應","Two rockets share a row. Fire one — its blast sets off the other. Chained specials earn big bonus points.":"兩枚火箭共用一排。開一個 — 佢嘅爆炸會引發另一個。連鎖特價可以賺取大量獎賞積分。","Make a bomb":"做個炸彈","Groups of 8 or more leave a bomb that clears everything around it. Pop the huge cherry cluster to forge one.":"8 人或以上嘅小組留低一個炸彈，可以清除周圍嘅所有嘢。彈出巨大嘅櫻桃群，就可以鍛造出一個。","Finish the stage":"完成個舞台","The goal rail (left) asks for 2 cherry cubes. Pop the cherry pair to complete the stage — that is a win.":"球門軌道（左）要求2個櫻桃立方體。彈出櫻桃對就可以完成舞台 — 噉就係贏咗。","Second chances":"第二次機會","In relaxed modes you can undo a pop (U) or ask for a hint (H). Pop any group, then undo it to finish the lesson.":"喺輕鬆模式下，你可以復原彈出（ U ）或者要求提示（ H ）。彈出任何一個群組，然後復原佢嚟完成課堂。","First Pop":"第一個流行音樂","Pop your first group of cubes.":"彈出你第一組立方體。","Goal Getter":"目標達人","Complete all goals in a stage.":"完成一個關卡嘅所有目標。","Rocketeer":"火箭兵","Forge your first rocket.":"鍛造你嘅第一個火箭。","Demolitionist":"拆除專家","Forge your first bomb.":"鍛造你嘅第一個炸彈。","Chain Artist":"連鎖藝術家","Fire 3+ specials in a single move.":"單招發射 3 + 特殊。","Crowd Pleaser":"討好群眾","Pop a group of 12 or more cubes.":"彈出一組12個或以上嘅立方體。","Cube Veteran":"方塊老手","Clear 1000 cubes in total.":"總共清除 1000 個方塊。","Half the Journey":"旅程過半","Finish 20 journey stages.":"完成 20 個旅程關卡。","Studio Master":"工作室大師","Finish all 40 journey stages.":"完成所有 40 個旅程階段。","Regular":"常規","Finish 7 daily challenges.":"完成 7 個每日挑戰。","High Shelf":"高處","Score 3000+ in a single round.":"單一回合取得 3000+ 分。","Music, effects and voice volumes and mute are in the StarHermit Options.":"音樂、效果與語音音量及靜音都在 StarHermit 選項中。","Open Options":"開啟選項","Graphics":"畫面","Graphics quality, render scale and frame rate are in the StarHermit Options.":"畫質、渲染比例同幀率設定喺 StarHermit 選項入面。","Reduced motion, high contrast (with the high-contrast cube palette) and text size are in the StarHermit Options.":"減少嘅動作、高對比度（用高對比度立方體調色板）同文字大小都喺星隱士選項入面。","Change keys and buttons":"更改按鍵同按鈕","Reset":"重設","Cancel":"取消"}
